sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (Browser)
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP TLS edge
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP
    participant Backend as Backend API<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Ollama as Ollama LLM<br/>11434/TCP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MC as RHOAI Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 1: Conversational Recommendation (End-to-End)

    User->>Router: HTTPS/443 (TLS edge termination)
    Router->>UI: HTTP/8501
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>HTTP/8000 (no auth)
    Backend->>Ollama: POST /api/chat<br/>HTTP/11434 (no auth)
    Ollama-->>Backend: Structured intent (JSON)
    Backend->>HF: GET model config<br/>HTTPS/443 (HF_TOKEN optional)
    HF-->>Backend: Model metadata + params
    Backend->>PG: SQL query benchmarks<br/>5432/TCP (password auth)
    PG-->>Backend: Benchmark results
    Note over Backend: Multi-criteria scoring<br/>+ GPU memory estimation<br/>+ roofline performance
    Backend-->>UI: Ranked recommendations (JSON)
    UI-->>Router: HTML response
    Router-->>User: HTTPS response

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 2: Model Catalog Benchmark Sync (Background)

    Note over Backend: Background daemon thread<br/>triggered on startup
    Backend->>MC: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/...<br/>HTTPS/8443 (SA token, service-ca TLS)
    MC-->>Backend: Model artifacts + benchmarks
    Backend->>PG: DELETE source='model_catalog'<br/>INSERT new benchmarks<br/>5432/TCP (password auth)

    Note over User,K8s: Flow 3: Kubernetes Deployment

    User->>Router: HTTPS/443
    Router->>UI: HTTP/8501
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/deploy<br/>HTTP/8000 (no auth)
    Note over Backend: Jinja2 template rendering<br/>KServe InferenceService YAML<br/>or llm-d kustomize/Helm
    Backend-->>UI: Generated YAML files

    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/deploy-to-cluster<br/>HTTP/8000 (no auth)
    Backend->>K8s: kubectl apply -f<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
    K8s-->>Backend: Deployment status
    Backend-->>UI: Deployment confirmation
    UI-->>Router: Result page
    Router-->>User: HTTPS response
